# Response Intelligence Directive

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-response-intelligence-directive.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-response-intelligence-directive.md)  
**Output contract:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-response-contract.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-response-contract.md)

**Module:** `src/lib/response-contract` · `src/lib/response-intelligence` · composer: `src/lib/caregiver-response-composer`

## MVP blocker

Not storage/ingestion. **Output quality** — trustworthy care understanding from messy input.

Order: Input → Meaning → Compare LCR → Changes/relationships/unknowns → Output.  
Never: Input → Fill JSON → Text.

## Non-negotiable

**NO hardcoded response patterns** — no keyword triggers, phrase-matched caregiver copy, emotional category scripts, condition templates.

Examples in docs = illustrations only — never product if-branches.

## Internal (never expose)

Reality understanding · Change detection · Relationship understanding · Uncertainty preservation

## Caregiver sees

Understand · Changed · Unclear · Connected · Matters now / can wait  
Never: extracted / analyzed / detected / confidence / classification / sentiment / care event created

## Emotion

Emotion → context → clarity. Never therapy chatbot.

## Documents

What changed in the care story — never file/OCR/extraction chrome.

## Questions

≤1–3; only if answer changes understanding.

## Success

Tired caregiver: chaos became clearer — not “impressive AI answer.”
